# Dormant Powers Dislodged (jeuno 136), the level either side of 85 and of 75 (> 85 / >= 75 / below) and the Limit
# Breaker: Warriors at cap 90, the three earlier limit breaks completed (level 86 with the key is the main flow's). Level
# 74 (main): 10045 (74, 1, 0, 0, 0, drawn); 75 (c75): (75, 1, 3, 2, ...); 85 (c85): (85, 1, 3, 2, ...); level 86 without
# the Limit Breaker (nokey): (86, 2, 0, 0, ...). Each draws its own item.
lists RuludeGardens/Nomad_Moogle/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/10045
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=74
char c75 zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=75
char c85 zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=85
char nokey zone=RuludeGardens pos=10.0,1.5,119.9 job=WAR lvl=86
keyitem LimitBreaker
levelcap 90
quest Jeuno.BeyondTheStars completed
c75: keyitem LimitBreaker
c75: levelcap 90
c75: quest Jeuno.BeyondTheStars completed
c85: keyitem LimitBreaker
c85: levelcap 90
c85: quest Jeuno.BeyondTheStars completed
nokey: levelcap 90
nokey: quest Jeuno.BeyondTheStars completed
login
trigger Nomad_Moogle                    # level 74: 10045 (74, 1, 0, 0, 0, drawn)
finish option=0
c75: login
c75: trigger Nomad_Moogle               # level 75: 10045 (75, 1, 3, 2, 0, drawn)
c75: finish option=0
c85: login
c85: trigger Nomad_Moogle               # level 85: 10045 (85, 1, 3, 2, 0, drawn)
c85: finish option=0
nokey: login
nokey: trigger Nomad_Moogle             # no Limit Breaker: 10045 (86, 2, 0, 0, 0, drawn)
nokey: finish option=0
